      }
    },
    {
      "description": "a genuine hard failure (not SAP_ERROR) -> tagged via _hard_failure instead of producing a normal _record_result -- folds in what used to be a separate Has Hard Failure? IF node, since branching the main per-record edge and reconverging it downstream was confirmed live to break Group Results By Intent's own aggregation",
